Expanded Delight - Minecraft 26.1.2 / NeoForge port

Original mod, code, and assets: ianm1647
Original project: https://github.com/ianm1647/expandeddelight
Original listing: https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/expanded-delight
Upstream branch: 1.21-neo
Upstream version: 0.1.4 for Minecraft 1.21.1 / NeoForge
Upstream baseline: ea826400654702587e86c9e94544bfd74f065083

Port repository: https://github.com/fiddleyowl/expandeddelight
Port branch: 26.1.2-neoforge
Port version: 0.1.4+mc26.1.2

Port changes include Java 25 and NeoForge 26.1.2 build configuration, block and
item registration, consumption components, container returns, juicer recipes
and persistence, recipe book and screen APIs, client recipe synchronization,
cinnamon boat integration, data-driven villager trades, resource formats,
world generation data, loot modifiers, and JEI/KubeJS compatibility.

